# Environment Configuration Template

This file documents all required environment variables for production deployment.

## Backend Configuration (`backend/.env`)

### Required Variables

```bash
# Application
APP_NAME=Shopee AI Ops
APP_ENV=production
APP_DEBUG=false

# Database (PostgreSQL for production)
POSTGRES_DSN=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/shopee_ai_ops

# Security - MUST CHANGE IN PRODUCTION
SESSION_SECRET_KEY=<generate-32-char-random-string>
PLATFORM_AUTH_STATE_SECRET=<generate-32-char-random-string>
TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=<generate-64-hex-char-key-for-aes-gcm>
CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-domain.com

# Shopee OAuth
SHOPEE_CLIENT_ID=<your-shopee-client-id>
SHOPEE_CLIENT_SECRET=<your-shopee-client-secret>
SHOPEE_REDIRECT_URI=https://your-domain.com/api/v1/platform-connections/shopee/callback

# 1688 OAuth (if applicable)
ALIBABA_CLIENT_ID=<your-alibaba-client-id>
ALIBABA_CLIENT_SECRET=<your-alibaba-client-secret>
ALIBABA_REDIRECT_URI=https://your-domain.com/api/v1/platform-connections/1688/callback

# Redis (optional, for task queues)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
```

### Generating Secrets

```bash
# Generate a secure session secret key
python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"

# Generate an HMAC secret for state tokens
python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"

# Generate a 32-byte AES-GCM encryption key (64 hex chars)
python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
```

## Frontend Configuration (`frontend/.env.local`)

### Required Variables

```bash
# API endpoint
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://your-domain.com/api/v1
```

## Development Defaults

The system ships with development-friendly defaults:

- `APP_ENV=development` - Enables debug mode
- `APP_DEBUG=true` - Shows detailed error messages
- SQLite database (`dev.db`) - No PostgreSQL required
- Demo OAuth credentials - For testing only

## Security Checklist

Before production deployment:

- [ ] Generate new `SESSION_SECRET_KEY`
- [ ] Generate new `PLATFORM_AUTH_STATE_SECRET`
- [ ] Generate new `TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY` (64 hex chars for AES-GCM)
- [ ] Configure PostgreSQL `POSTGRES_DSN`
- [ ] Set `APP_DEBUG=false`
- [ ] Configure `CORS_ORIGINS` to your domain only
- [ ] Obtain real Shopee OAuth credentials
- [ ] Configure HTTPS with valid certificates
- [ ] Set up database backups

